  "debtToEquityTTM": null,
  "description": "APi Group Corporation operates as a global enterprise offering vital safety, specialized infrastructure, and industrial services across North America, Europe, Australia, and the Asia-Pacific region. Its business activities are segmented into three primary divisions: Safety Services, Specialty Services, and Industrial Services. The Safety Services division delivers comprehensive safety solutions, with a particular focus on integrated occupancy systems. This encompasses the full lifecycle of services for fire protection, heating, ventilation, and air conditioning (HVAC), and entry systems, from their initial design and installation to ongoing inspection, monitoring, and maintenance. The Specialty Services segment is dedicated to the upkeep and enhancement of critical infrastructure, including subterranean electric, gas, water, sewer, and telecommunications networks, as well as specialized industrial facilities. This segment's offerings span a broad range of services, including engineering, design, fabrication, installation, and the modernization or upgrading of existing systems. Within the Industrial Services segment, APi Group provides a variety of solutions primarily to the energy industry, emphasizing transmission and distribution. Its services include the construction of pipeline infrastructure, access roads, and supporting facilities, alongside integrity management and maintenance to ensure the longevity and reliability of these assets. The company serves a diverse clientele that spans both public and private sectors. This extensive customer base includes commercial, industrial, and manufacturing operations, fulfillment and distribution centers, educational and healthcare institutions, telecommunications firms, utility providers, high-tech companies, entertainment venues, retailers, financial service organizations, and governmental entities. Formed in 1926, APi Group Corporation adopted its current name in October 2019, having previously been known as J2 Acquisition Limited. The company's corporate headquarters are situated in New Brighton, Minnesota.",
